// spec: `union enum class` is no kpp: every typed union's tags are scoped (design.md 8.4, 8.5; kovarex 2026-11-18), so `union enum U` is what it was
// error: union_enum_class_is_error.kpp:3: error: kpp's enums are all scoped: write `union enum Name`, not `union enum class Name`
union enum class Action : u8
{
  { {Move, int}, {Stop, void} }
};
int main()
{
  return 0;
}
